{"id":"wb-8-355","name":"丹霞寺塔林","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"丹霞寺塔林","text":"丹霞寺塔林是中国河南省南阳市南召县留山镇丹霞寺周围的僧人墓塔群，位于马窝村一带，现存墓塔的年代自元朝至清朝。塔群分布于寺院周边山地和柏树林中，包含砖塔和石塔两类。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B8%B9%E9%9C%9E%E5%AF%BA%E5%A1%94%E6%9E%97","revisionId":95386736,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95386736","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":null}